  "id": "asap-demo-complex-full",
  "labels": [
    {
      "cardinality": 4,
      "name": "region"
    },
    {
      "cardinality": 5,
      "child_of": "region",
      "name": "service"
    },
    {
      "cardinality": 10,
      "child_of": "service",
      "name": "job"
    },
    {
      "cardinality": 50,
      "child_of": "job",
      "name": "label_0"
    }
  ],
  "metric_names": {
    "data": "request_latency_seconds",
    "data_total": "http_errors_total"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Data are made semantically valid for both engines alike (FEEDER_VALUES=zipf plus value_overrides):",
    "http_request_duration_seconds_bucket: per sample interval of each (region, service, job) a Zipf(1.1) number of observations in 1..20, each a log-normal latency (median 0.05 s, sigma 1.0); every bucket counts the observations <= its le, so buckets are cumulative and monotonic across le (+Inf = all); no resets.",
    "cache_hits_total = per sample floor(cache_lookups_total increment x a per-series hit ratio in [0.5, 0.99]), resetting with lookups: hits <= lookups always.",
    "http_errors_total (5 label_0 series per job) = per sample floor(http_requests_total increment of the job x a per-series ratio in [0, 0.02]), resetting with requests: errors summed per job <= 10% of requests.",
    "Other counters: Zipf(1.1, N=1e6) integer increments, 5% of series reset every 30-120 min; gauges: Zipf integers x an integer per-series multiplier.",
    "asap-demo-complex: windows x1/6 of the original (6h->1h, 1h->10m, 30m->5m, 60s->10s, 30s->5s, offset 1h->10m)."
  ],
  "queries": [
    {
      "grouping": [],
      "id": "A-error-ratio",
      "interval_ms": 15000,
      "lookback_ms": 21600000,
      "metrics": [
        "http_errors_total",
        "http_requests_total"
      ],
      "promql": "(increase(http_errors_total[6h]) / on(job) group_left() increase(http_requests_total[6h])) > 0.01",
      "rqes": [
        {
          "accuracy_sla": 0.95,
          "capability": "sum",
          "grouping_labels": [],
          "id": "A-error-ratio/rqe",
          "interval_ms": 15000,
          "lookback_ms": 21600000,
          "metric": "http_errors_total"
        }
      ],
      "sql": null,
      "support": "common-promql"
    },
    {
      "grouping": [],
      "id": "B-capacity",
      "interval_ms": 15000,
      "lookback_ms": 21600000,
      "metrics": [
        "http_requests_total",
        "capacity_rps"
      ],
      "promql": "(rate(http_requests_total[30s]) * 100 / on(job) group_left() max_over_time(capacity_rps[6h])) >= 80",
      "rqes": [
        {
          "accuracy_sla": 0.95,
          "capability": "max",
          "grouping_labels": [],
          "id": "B-capacity/rqe",
          "interval_ms": 15000,
          "lookback_ms": 21600000,
          "metric": "http_requests_total"
        }
      ],
      "sql": null,
      "support": "common-promql"
    },
    {
      "grouping": [],
      "id": "C-cache-hit",
      "interval_ms": 15000,
      "lookback_ms": 60000,
      "metrics": [
        "cache_hits_total",
        "cache_lookups_total"
      ],
      "promql": "(avg by (region, service, job) (rate(cache_hits_total[60s]) / rate(cache_lookups_total[60s])) * 100) >= 90",
      "rqes": [
        {
          "accuracy_sla": 0.95,
          "capability": "sum",
          "grouping_labels": [],
          "id": "C-cache-hit/rqe",
          "interval_ms": 15000,
          "lookback_ms": 60000,
          "metric": "cache_hits_total"
        }
      ],
      "sql": null,
      "support": "common-promql"
    },
    {
      "grouping": [],
      "id": "D-count-regions",
      "interval_ms": 15000,
      "lookback_ms": 1800000,
      "metrics": [
        "http_requests_total"
      ],
      "promql": "count by (region) (sum by (region, service) (increase(http_requests_total[30m])) > 1000)",
      "rqes": [
        {
          "accuracy_sla": 0.95,
          "capability": "sum",
